<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highlands says no Placer legal action.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highlands says no Placer legal action.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highlands Gold Ltd said on Tuesday it would not proceed with litigation plans against Placer Dome Inc in relation to the Canadian gold miner's takeover offer.</p>
</text>
